&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-803520-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. The specifics of SCP-5925&#039;s escape has been omitted in keeping with protocol 5925-Eshu.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-803520-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Described as akin to those of a stag.&lt;/div&gt;
