				<title>Foundation Cool Achievement Badges</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/dark-achievement-badges</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;display: none&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348532&quot; alt=&quot;EstrellaYoshte&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte&quot;  &gt;EstrellaYoshte&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2020 04:58:41 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>Borrowing the words of <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348532" alt="RJB_R" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" >RJB_R</a></span>:</p> <blockquote> <p><em>This is a just-for-fun type of page for people to list their accomplishments and provide badges for display on their author pages.</em></p> </blockquote> <p>The primary goal of this page is a visually neat way to showcase user's achievements, as well as to encourage community engagement. All the badges below aim to be as vote-independent as possible.</p> <p>Since I can not enforce the requirements for these, this will based on an honor system, in which I hope everyone strives to give their best shot, and remembers to have fun!</p> <hr /> <div class="casercontainer"> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>TSF</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/tsf.png" width="160px" alt="tsf.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Ten Steps Forward</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Have 10 pages published on the wiki.<br /> (Fragment pages do not count, if you're wondering.)</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>MWW</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/mww.png" width="160px" alt="mww.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Mr. Worldwide</span></h1> <hr /> <p>A work of yours is translated to 5 or more foreign languages, OR you have translated 6 works from one language to another.</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>CCC</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/ccc.png" width="160px" alt="ccc.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Canon Crossover Central</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Write an article involving 3 (or more) canons. Tales series and other incorporated settings with dedicated hubs are permitted for the purpose of this achievement.</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>SEK</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/sek.png" width="160px" alt="sek.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>The SEXTANK Initiative</span></h1> <hr /> <p>You have written: <strong>S</strong>afe, <strong>E</strong>uclid, <strong>K</strong>eter, <strong>T</strong>haumiel, <strong>N</strong>eutralized, E<strong>x</strong>plained + <strong>A</strong>nother Esoteric-class.<br /> (The absence of Object Class altogether does not qualify as esoteric.)</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>SCL</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/scl.png" width="160px" alt="scl.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Social Butterfly</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Leave detailed and constructive critique in the comments 20 times.<br /> Use your judgement as to what qualifies as detailed and constructive. Ideas and draft critiques also count.</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>CLB</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:sybadge/clb.png" width="160px" alt="clb.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Thank You for Your Cooperation</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Collaborate with at least 7 other authors.<br /> This could be 7 different co-authored pages or one co-authored page with your 7 co-authors, and everything in-between (You must be credited as a co-author to qualify.)</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>DDA</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/dda.png" width="160px" alt="dda.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Double Double Agent</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Write 4 or more distinct GoI Formats (at least one article for each four GoIs.)</p> </div> <div class="caser"> <div class="codecon"> <h5><span>GSA</span></h5> </div> <br /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/gsa.png" width="160px" alt="gsa.png" class="image" /> <h1><span>Guest Star Appearance</span></h1> <hr /> <p>Write an article featuring an SCP, GoI, character or other major elements originating from a foreign branch (Bonus points if it's an obscure one!)</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>To have the badges on your page, put the following in:</p> <div class="darkbox" style="font-family: monospace;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[=]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;component:sybadge&#32;code=aaa]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;component:sybadge&#32;code=bbb]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/=]]</span></p> </div> <br /> In place of <em>aaa</em> and <em>bbb</em>, use the three-letter key at the top left of the card corresponding to your chosen badge (all lowercase). <div style="text-align: center;"><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/sek.png" style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #21252E,#2F333C); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="sek.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="sek"> </span></span></span><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/scl.png" style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #21252E,#2F333C); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="scl.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="scl"> </span></span></span></div> <p>To change the color of the badge border, put the following after all the <tt>[[include]]</tt> (you only need one):</p> <div class="darkbox" style="font-family: monospace;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br /> :root {<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;--borderColor:&#32;(COLOR&#32;HERE);</span><br /> }<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> </div> <p>By default, the border's color is #CEA0FF.</p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h1><span>Got an idea for one?</span></h1> <p>This page will continue to be updated with new achievements.<br /> If you think there's something that needs to be added, leave a comment! I'll do my best to accommodate them!</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348532" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> 
