&lt;p&gt;Aside from my bragging, we should get into things ACTUALLY about me. I’m 16, se/sim/serself, in marching band, jazz band, and concert band. I play bassoon, piano, and synth. We here in Texas love our football, but I just enjoy marching band. I have made region band 3 times, and honestly if you get me talking about band I may never shut up!&lt;/p&gt;
