&lt;p&gt;Wait, one more thing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If life happens, and I decide to leave the site, I die, or I otherwise don&#039;t exist for 4 years, without anyone knowing about my whereabouts and having the ability to contact me, then I wish for &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;Lt Flops&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;Lt Flops&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to take ownership of all of my articles (aside from collaborations, which go to their co-authors), and all matters of deletion, porting and licensing are to be forwarded to her. &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;Calibri Bold&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold&quot;  &gt;Calibri Bold&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Has my phone number and he&#039;s cool, so if I’m dead or just disappear he’d know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Team Bird Art Page is a special case and should be handled by the Team Bird Team (&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;not_a_seagull&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull&quot;  &gt;not_a_seagull&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;Lt Flops&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;Lt Flops&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;Ayers&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers&quot;  &gt;Ayers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2033292&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608348534&quot; alt=&quot;Quantum Physician&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2033292)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician&quot;  &gt;Quantum Physician&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) They’re great people and I have trust in them (Maybe too much.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s it. Go home, you can not stay here!&lt;/p&gt;
