						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="logo"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/logo.png" alt="logo.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="anchor"> <div class="sidebox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Latest Page:</span></span></h3> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Pages I recommend:</span></span></h3> </div> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">My Artdesk</a> - Where all my logos comes from.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5552">SCP-5552</a> - One of my favorite SCPs.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/artpage-fartpage">lynch artpage fartpage</a> - A really cool and fun 3D artpage!</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/theme:flopstyle">Flopstyle CSS</a> - Very floppy.</p> </div> </div> <div class="header-container"> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>QUALIFIED?</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>TOTALLY</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>OBJECT CLASS:</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>RADICAL</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="grid-item"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/u.png" style="width:300px;" alt="u.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>An alleged self-portrait.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="textbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">My autobiography:</span></span></h2> <p>lol no, that just seems tiring<br /> sounds fun and cool tho, prolly<br /> im too lazy to write one<br /> but you can pretend i did</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-f17c61639395aea90554ee61ea754212" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>About me, for real</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>My Articles</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>Hello, I'm <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span>, aka <strong>SYwaves</strong>, aka &quot;the one who makes a bunch of logos&quot;, aka &quot;dude with one too many theme&quot;, and this is my &quot;author&quot; page.</p> <p>I'm more of an artist by trade, and can be found lounging outside the wiki once in a blue moon.</p> <p>What other users say about me:</p> <div class="blockquote"> <p>Estrella do you even have 3 articles that aren't themes?<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>sywaves makes good logos. sywaves does good iconography and symbolism. sywaves makes good themes. sywaves makes good art.<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>Do you even write anything, Estrella?<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>the logos and themes you have made for this website have propelled you into household name status<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>idk you made a theme or something, it was neato-mosquito<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>germany<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a hr