st 6 months than anyone else. The only reason I still have my job is because they're too busy making themes to take it.</p> </blockquote> <p>– <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" >Elunerazim</a></span>, SCPDeclassified Moderator, whose job's about to be taken.</p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Achievements:</span></span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/tsf.png" style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #21252E,#2F333C); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="tsf.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="tsf"> </span></span></span></div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608348539" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> 
